SUMMARY:WSDM 2027 · Abstract submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:ACM International Conference on Web Search and Data Mining\nMee
 ting: 2027-02-15 to 2027-02-19\, Hong Kong\, China\nStatus: confirmed\, c
 hecked 2026-10-30\nFormat: Paper-based\nOfficial source: https://www.wsdm
 -conference.org/2027/cffp.html\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/ve
 nue-radar/#wsdm-2027\nNotes: Official WSDM 2027 pages (rechecked 2026-10-
 30) list Hong Kong (Cordis)\, Feb 15-19\, and AoE deadlines: full-paper a
 bstract Aug 17 and paper Aug 24\, 2026 (closed\; notification Nov 2)\, sh
 ort papers (up to 4 pages\, new work) Nov 17\, doctoral consortium (singl
 e-author student packet) Nov 12\, and WSDM Day presentations Nov 30\, 202
 6 (2-page extended abstract on search\, data mining and agentic AI\; unpu
 blished or under-review work welcome\; oral or poster on Feb 19\, in the 
 proceedings). Demo papers closed Oct 15\, 2026. Industry Day talk proposa
 ls (2 pages with speaker bio\, due Oct 30) are not tracked as a paper rou
 te.
CATEGORIES:Data Mining & Data Science,Machine Learning,Fairness & Responsib
 le AI,Human-AI Interaction & Deployment
URL:https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html
END:VEVENT
