SUMMARY:ECIR 2027 · Full-paper abstract deadline
DESCRIPTION:European Conference on Information Retrieval\nMeeting: 2027-03-
 21 to 2027-03-25\, Southampton\, UK\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-
 30\nFormat: Paper-based\nOfficial source: https://www.ecir2027.co.uk/call
 -for-full-papers\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#eci
 r-2027\nNotes: Rechecked 2026-10-30. The full-paper call states 11:59pm A
 oE for its closed Sep 21 abstract gate and Oct 5 paper\; the short\, repl
 icability and resource calls give days only. Resource papers (Nov 2\, no 
 abstract step) report original research resources\; no extension was foun
 d. IR-for-Good papers (closed Oct 5)\, demos and Industry Day proposals (
