 -conference.org/2027/cfp.html\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/ven
 ue-radar/#wsdm-2027\nNotes: Official WSDM 2027 pages (rechecked 2026-10-3
 0) list Hong Kong (Cordis)\, Feb 15-19\, and AoE deadlines: full-paper ab
 stract Aug 17 and paper Aug 24\, 2026 (closed\; notification Nov 2)\, sho
 rt papers (up to 4 pages\, new work) Nov 17\, doctoral consortium (single
