SUMMARY:WWW 2027 · Resource paper submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:ACM Web Conference (formerly International World Wide Web Confe
 rence)\nMeeting: 2027-05-10 to 2027-05-14\, Dublin\, Ireland\nStatus: con
 firmed\, checked 2026-10-30\nFormat: Paper-based\nOfficial source: https:
 //www2027.thewebconf.org/resource-submissions/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-
 uri.github.io/venue-radar/#www-2027\nNotes: Full-paper abstract and paper
  deadlines (Oct 18/25 AoE) have passed with no extension. The short-paper
  OpenReview portal was observed open on 2026-10-30\; separate mandatory a
 bstract gates apply. Resource papers (four pages\, non-anonymous\, compan
 ion proceedings) are due Dec 17 AoE\; their portal is not public yet. Ope
 nReview's short-paper forms close about an hour after the AoE cutoffs sto
 red here. Demo papers (Nov 16 per the website)\, the PhD symposium (Jan 6
  per the website) and the general workshop-paper date (Jan 4\, workshops 
 not yet listed) are not tracked as separate routes\; the OpenReview demo 
 and PhD symposium forms are set to close Nov 15\, 21:00 UTC. The Web4Good
  track is discontinued. Research must substantively address the Web\, not
  merely use a web dataset. Preserve WWW as the stable series alias. Size 
 is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Information Retrieval & Search,Recommender Systems,Graphs & Grap
 h Learning,LLM Agents & Tool Use
URL:https://www2027.thewebconf.org/resource-submissions/
